{
  "name": "Supabase Low-Code 節點與資料表存取",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ 範例 2：Supabase Low-Code 節點存取\n\n1. **免寫 SQL**：透過 Supabase REST API 直接在 n8n 視覺化選擇資料表與欄位。\n2. **自動寫入 (Create Row)**：接收表單資料，自動新增至 `customers` 表。\n3. **條件過濾查詢 (Get Many Rows)**：撈取所有 VIP 等級為 `Gold` 的尊榮客戶清單。\n4. **零摩擦整合**：適合前端 Webhook 與無程式碼業務流程。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        100
      ],
      "id": "supabase-lowcode-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "register-customer",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        380
      ],
      "id": "webhook-register-customer",
      "name": "接收會員註冊 Webhook",
      "webhookId": "register-customer-endpoint"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "tableId": "customers",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "name",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.name || '張美華' }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "email",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.email || 'hua_' + Date.now() + '@example.com' }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "phone",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.phone || '0988-123-456' }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "vip_level",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.vip_level || 'Gold' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        380
      ],
      "id": "supabase-create-row",
      "name": "Supabase 寫入客戶",
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_SUPABASE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Supabase API account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "customers",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 10,
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "vip_level",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "Gold"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        380
      ],
      "id": "supabase-get-gold-vips",
      "name": "Supabase 查詢 Gold VIP 清單",
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_SUPABASE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Supabase API account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "接收會員註冊 Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Supabase 寫入客戶",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Supabase 寫入客戶": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Supabase 查詢 Gold VIP 清單",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
